  "domain": "bake_map/normal",
  "description": "Tier 2b bake golden of phase3.2_baker-normal (decision 384) on the analytic fixture sphere: the sphere on its ground, baked low as high. Painter bakes Normal at 512 px (OutputSize 9, DilationWidth 0, LowAsHigh True, RelativeScale False, MaxHeight 0.01, MaxDepth 0.01; every other baking parameter at Painter's default; normal map format OpenGL, tangent space the project default). The baked maps are exported as PNG 16 and OpenEXR 32f, padding passthrough, no dithering; recorded twice (same session; after save and reopen). Bake backend uncontrolled.",
  "inputs": [
    {
      "input_id": "sphere-on-ground",
      "kind": "mesh",
      "path": "parity/fixtures/tier2b-bakes/sphere-on-ground.obj",
